Licensing of the files in this directory
========================================

kazakh.sbl, stemwords.c, eval_snowball.py, make_voc.py, stemmer.tt
-------------------------------------------------------------------

These files are original work written for submission to the Snowball
project (https://snowballstem.org/).  They contain no material derived from
the Apertium kaz lexicon or any other GPL source; the suffix tables are
written from the standard grammar of Kazakh, and the design choices were
made from retrieval measurements described in stemmer.tt.

They are intended to be licensed under the 3-clause BSD licence that
Snowball uses, reproduced below.  The repository owner must confirm this
before the files are submitted upstream; until then they are covered by the
licence of the repository as a whole.

